{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/extras/\u7ecf\u8425\u5c5e\u4e8e\u4f60\u7684\u9910\u5385\uff01.png?t=1740579337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage Your Restaurant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a one-of-a-kind restaurant in a fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet incredible guests and make them regular customers.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/extras/\u88c5\u4fee.png?t=1740579337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Renovate and transform your restaurant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize your restaurant with various styles of furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attract more guests and establish your own style.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/extras/\u62db\u52df\u5458\u5de5.png?t=1740579337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit Employees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit employees and collect various interesting ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work with the restaurant staff to make the restaurant better.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/extras/\u5730\u56fe.png?t=1740579337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go to Various Locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interesting world, go and experience all kinds of things in the world.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/extras/npc.png?t=1740579337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with various interesting characters and make them regular customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build friendships and learn about their stories.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/extras/\u5176\u4ed6.png?t=1740579337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443450?t=1740579337","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740579337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/8865ea7e67333fefc64abae0cfe4cdb90372cf39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740579337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/8865ea7e67333fefc64abae0cfe4cdb90372cf39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740579337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/extras/\u7ecf\u8425\u5c5e\u4e8e\u4f60\u7684\u9910\u5385\uff01.png?t=1740579337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage Your Restaurant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a one-of-a-kind restaurant in a fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet incredible guests and make them regular customers.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/extras/\u88c5\u4fee.png?t=1740579337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Renovate and transform your restaurant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize your restaurant with various styles of furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attract more guests and establish your own style.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443450/extras/\u62db\u52df\u5458\u5de5.png?t=1740579337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit Employees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit employees and collect various interestin